OL,3,GNEWSASemi-pro football club 'in shock'
OL,4,Aafter shirt worn by Reading Festival
OL,5,Aheadliners
OL,6,
OL,7,FA semi-professional Welsh football club
OL,8,Fsay they were "in shock" after their
OL,9,Fshirt was worn during a Reading
OL,10,FFestival headline set.
OL,12,FFontaines D.C. frontman Grian Chatten
OL,13,Fwas seen sporting a green and
OL,14,Fwhite-striped Cwmbran away shirt during
OL,15,Fthe performance on Friday, leading to
OL,16,Fpre-sales of the shirt to "almost
OL,17,Fdouble".
OL,19,FIn a post shared on social media, the
OL,20,Fclub said "we're still in shock and
OL,21,Fcan't thank Grian enough for the
OL,22,Fsupport".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
