OL,3,GNEWSASemi-pro football club 'in shock'
OL,4,Aafter shirt worn by Reading Festival
OL,5,Aheadliners
OL,6,
OL,7,FSales of the shirt go both towards
OL,8,Fsupporting the club as well as to
OL,9,Fgrassroots music venues, with the club
OL,10,Fhaving partnered with four famous bands
OL,11,Ffor their 2026/27 season team kits.
